  "releaseNotes": "Remove redundant append overloads; handle negatives:\n      - Remove two unused append helpers from Buffer.cs (Append(char) and AppendUtf8(byte)) to reduce duplication.\n      - Update Utf8Builder to use Cache.Append(byte) and add handling for negative TimeSpan values by emitting a '-' and formatting the absolute value (timeSpan.Duration()).\n      - This preserves existing positive formatting while properly serializing negative durations.",
